**Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Resource Delivery**

| Goal ID | Goal Title | Text (justification) | Runtime Annotation | Goal Type | Relation |
|---------|------------|-----------------------|--------------------|-----------|----------|
| G1 | **Complete Resource Delivery Mission** | *Achieve* the overall mission: all requested resources are collected from storage and delivered to the requesting agent at the specified location. | `;` | Achieve | – |
| G2 | **Perform Collection Phase** | *Perform* the collection tasks (navigate, request, wait, monitor battery). | `;` | Perform | G1 |
| G3 | **Perform Delivery Phase** | *Perform* the delivery tasks (navigate, pick‑up, deliver, monitor battery). | `;` | Perform | G2 |
| G2.1 | **Determine Visit Order** | *Query* the optimal order of visiting storages based on waiting time and path length. | `-` | Query | G2 |
| G2.2 | **Execute Collection Tasks** | *Perform* collection tasks with a fallback to low‑battery handling. | `FALLBACK(G2.2a,G2.2b)` | Perform | G2 |
| G2.2a | **Normal Collection Tasks** | Standard collection when battery is sufficient. | `;` | Perform | G2.2 |
| G2.2b | **Low‑Battery Handling** | Handle low battery in collection: recharge and assign mission to another robot. | `;` | Perform | G2.2 |
| G3.1 | **Execute Delivery Tasks** | *Perform* delivery tasks with a fallback to low‑battery handling. | `FALLBACK(G3.1a,G3.1b)` | Perform | G3 |
| G3.1a | **Normal Delivery Tasks** | Standard delivery when battery is sufficient. | `;` | Perform | G3.1 |
| G3.1b | **Low‑Battery Handling** | Handle low battery in delivery: return resource to checkpoint and assign remaining task to another robot. | `;` | Perform | G3.1 |
| G3.2 | **Handle Failure to Return Resource** | Trigger alert and report to sector manager if the resource cannot be returned to a checkpoint. | `-` | Perform | G3 |

